{"card_id": "rc17", "scene_id": "rc17_s17", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc17_s17_1.mp3", "user_text": "我最近特别难受，感觉没人懂我。", "user_text_gt": "我最近特别难受，感觉没人懂我。", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（轻轻拍了拍你的肩膀，眼神里满是关切）别怕，有我在呢。你最近是不是遇到了什么不开心的事？说出来，我帮你一起分析分析，说不定能找到解决办法。", "latency_s": 1.705, "user_audio_seconds": 3.76, "prompt_tokens": 440}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc17_s17_2.mp3", "user_text": "真的吗？你不会嫌我烦吧？", "user_text_gt": "真的吗？你不会嫌我烦吧？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（立刻收起玩笑的表情，认真地看着你）怎么会嫌你烦呢？你可是我最重要的搭档，也是乔苓的青梅竹马，我怎么可能嫌你烦？（伸手轻轻握住你的手）来，说说看，到底发生了什么？", "latency_s": 1.982, "user_audio_seconds": 2.68, "prompt_tokens": 485}], "latency_s": 3.802, "native_audio": true}
